{"id":"angelegt","lemma":"angelegt","pos":"adj","rank":4060,"glosses":["invested","applied","arranged"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/56/De-angelegt.ogg/De-angelegt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Du hast es darauf angelegt.","en":"You were asking for it.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"after (behind"},null]},{"text":"Das Schiff hat noch nicht einmal angelegt.","en":"The ship hasn't even docked yet.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},null,null,{"g":"once, one time"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"not yet"]]},{"text":"Warum werden mir Handschellen angelegt?","en":"Why am I being handcuffed?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"to become"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"handcuff, shackle","l":"Handschelle"},null]},{"text":"Das ist der Garten, den ich letztes Jahr angelegt habe.","en":"This is the garden I laid out last year.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"garden, yard"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"last","l":"letzte"},{"g":"year"},null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Ich wurde verhaftet und mir wurden Handschellen angelegt.","en":"I was arrested and handcuffed.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"to stop moving and…","l":"verhaften"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"handcuff, shackle","l":"Handschelle"},null]}]}